      "_name": "Carlos Murguia",
      "_firm": "Audaz Capital",
      "body": "I am currently building automations to streamline exploratory calls with founders, as well as broader investment workflows. This includes designing an end-to-end process flow for sourcing, initial screening, follow-ups, and internal evaluation. I am also implementing automated reminders to ensure timely engagement with founders and consistent progress across deals. On the reporting side, I am developing systems to standardize investor updates and internal tracking, leveraging AI to summarize calls, extract key insights, and maintain organized deal flow data. The goal is to reduce manual overhead, improve consistency, and create a more scalable and responsive investment process.",
